  "body": "Tucked away in a quiet cul-de-sac in the friendly Torbay community, this spacious four-bedroom home sits on a flat approximate 910m² freehold section, offering approximately 250m² of floor area across three levels. This property holds over 10 years of the current owner’s memories, but now that the kids have flown the nest, it is time to pass it on to new owners.\r\n\r\nThe main level is the beating heart of the home—a generous living area, kitchen and a convenient separate guest toilet—a comfortable and practical space for everyday family life.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you will find the master bedroom with an ensuite, along with another bedroom, creating a well-planned space for parents with smaller children, separated from the hustle and bustle of the living space. It can also serve as a study or home office, providing an ideal space for those who work from home.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, the two bedrooms, separate bathroom and toilet create a flexible area that works particularly well for teenagers, extended family, guests or as a granny flat.  The separate lounge is particularly handy for anyone needing a little more breathing space.\r\n\r\nThe property features a large double garage with plenty of room for storage, a tall carport for boats or caravans and ample on-site parking easily capable of accommodating an extra 3-4 vehicles to cover the practical needs of any busy household.\r\n\r\nOutside, Lush gardens and mature native trees attract abundant birdlife, creating a vibrant natural backdrop. The fully fenced backyard provides genuine usable space to play and embark on new adventures while you relax and soak in your very own slice of paradise.\r\n\r\nRest easy knowing you children can access top-tier schoolings. Around 6 mins drive, can take you to the stunning Long Bay Regional Park, perfect for family picnics, beach and scenic walks. All the amenities your need are close by, cafes, shops, medical centers, and more are within easy reach. Don't miss out, enjoy a safe, established neighborhood where families thrive and kids can make lifelong friends.",
